", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673751957_1104377442478481_43621429993017455_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wEgL5B7N_a8Q7kNvwFY-S3q&_nc_oc=Adqyy_5k0j-0qv9EUTsUN6hA9nL38-ILV_f1Bibe0UkvRk9y_kt-OJEGtvouUCkurXY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMQ27e6K7hq6wKbRTs0kGlHYNVJLDKAULauzexuEppYfQ&oe=6AE5E81C"}]}, "id": "2051893772182987", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "CAPTURA_1.png", "id": "2844740125899924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_2844740129233257_5024251246639295263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCkbRqPOB4AQ7kNvwGbNPmm&_nc_oc=Ado2nQfjG2VD87V1XaAoHQifw5gktndeRQjZk17myASTvdAotAlwsTZ7JHYADggyV64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVTmPo022DeBK-HRjnUfq4VEVU-qezVXsET5hv2XvkxA&oe=6AE5EECC"}, {"file_name": "CAPTURAS_2.png", "id": "2519968171834965", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_2519968175168298_3449847040950740943_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yR6Q53MTZNMQ7kNvwFV7Rx_&_nc_oc=Adoa9esiPQwtBH8RqRbkJvQ27M1dwr_RLt3_P__gqIwsX7NHnooO2Q-67gWABbWpyzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOIUt8CEqXJq6IhGf107xbFwueTqbygy-iUArSc608AQQ&oe=6AE6119D"}, {"file_name": "CAPTURAS_3.png", "id": "2216617225951532", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_2216617232618198_4846079425985912590_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RrMqDbNqWrMQ7kNvwGQpXLZ&_nc_oc=AdplMqvHnr6ng1R59ZJyjftu_zjeRjDgjE4A1vo8C7WBgBvPMARtnY3Wip5OuJqAtgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMCgF5alo66-pdXcUgW3cXO5s2WlbUXsUoLENLKMOz6Sg&oe=6AE5FB97"}, {"file_name": "CAPTURAS_4.png", "id": "1650691319746141", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_1650691326412807_2419691361156730871_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQ9IoUtE6j0Q7kNvwFoWRUz&_nc_oc=AdoMxyuN7MRamebsXFcQHDjhgZ75rGcfXxBya1R9cWkMeAwTyyKozfHroJxxJs2QPvM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPU2m8_azID4xbV9EUjB3qsA-eCacmUYA8G02C8lj-Ezg&oe=6AE5E795"}, {"file_name": "CAPTURAS_5.png", "id": "1410262892161456", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/791586454_1410262905494788_8485095224906842823_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k8QbVpSADLsQ7kNvwHqdrlx&_nc_oc=Adpsy4SLoaGtgIBgH4jI68-hzjG0-vH3DyFpUK-NNUFprf9YfnUhcE5YAvQUluzJaV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPm0Hx0FEV91posRT_j3i8JMSe9o3rsOShRYnFhxFmEcA&oe=6AE60A93"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "KINEMA_Meta_Portada_Horizontal_2560x1440.png", "id": "38842341578747327", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673645340_38842341592080659_7160804285976712365_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hNAdl31NarIQ7kNvwEyD7Om&_nc_oc=AdqfN8ekaVzyHDeOVCmuCBCrs9tdLhIgpNG9bDQGXFDXAd5QLrQzh6eAS2d5ILsfkm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMkvUWJ_cI6b7bEYa5pEPsI7IcB9U2xOnhVx_CzZpRgNA&oe=6AE5E18E"}, "display_name": "KINEMA VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the Ages of Cinema. Film history becomes a place you can explore.\n\nKINEMA VR is a virtual reality film museum. From the lobby of a grand movie palace, you enter seven halls, each representing a different era:\n\n\u2022 Pre-cinema (1830\u20131890): a fairground tent featuring fully functional optical toys\u2014magic lantern, thaumatrope, zoetrope, praxinoscope, kinetoscope, mutoscope, and camera obscura.\n\u2022 Early Cinema (1895\u20131910): load the reel into the cinematograph and start the projection.\n\u2022 Silent Cinema (1910\u20131927): a Belle \u00c9poque theater hall complete with stage curtain.\n\u2022 Golden Age (1935\u20131960): an Art Deco palace featuring a projection booth and a screen that changes format.\n\u2022 Drive-in (1950s): grab the pole-mounted speaker and watch the movie under the stars.\n\u2022 IMAX (1970s onwards): the giant screen experience.\n\u2022 Digital & 3D (1999 onwards): put on your dual-color glasses.\n\nIn each hall, you can screen films: 18 audiovisual pieces created to evoke the style of each era, displayed in the format and on the screen typical of that time. The KINEMA Assistant guides you with a hall map, a movie schedule, and the history of each era.\n\nMovement is handled via teleportation and snap-turning; play standing or seated. Controls work with either controllers or hand tracking.\n\nA one-time purchase covers the entire experience: no ads, subscriptions, or extra purchases, and no account creation required. Available in Spanish and playable offline.\n\nIncludes some scenes of mild suspense and ", "short_description": "Experience the eras of cinema. Explore a grand movie palace and seven screening rooms representing different periods\u2014from a 19th-century fairground tent filled with optical toys to 3D digital cinema, taking in silent film, the Golden Age, a 1950s drive-in, and an IMAX theater along the way. In each room, you can open the program and screen movies on the technology of that era. Available in Spanish, at your own pace, and offline."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "3357174564482816", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON_512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_3357174567816149_8863425270860225540_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GGNLWejp8gYQ7kNvwGFQY8e&_nc_oc=AdrYiJMFmCR5aDEP9WPjxByA3cwoDQWhCIR7NVEVv95azK6kGbi6MHRQp8y2ADyzmzE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPa24NqQ2jDWHjlQDayPy0yQ503ywcN8U-t0B-ZEE38AA&oe=6AE614EC"}, {"file_name": "KINEMA_Meta_Portada_Horizontal_3000x900.png", "id": "2146971909037193", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5